   "id": "set-matrix-zeroes",
   "num": 1,
   "leet_id": 73,
   "title_cn": "矩阵置零",
   "title_en": "Set Matrix Zeroes",
   "difficulty": "中等",
   "category": "matrix",
   "tags": [
    "数组",
    "哈希表",
    "矩阵"
   ],
   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "给定一个 m x n 的矩阵，如果一个元素为 **0** ，则将其所在行和列的所有元素都设为 **0** 。请使用**原地**算法。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "matrix = [[1,1,1],[1,0,1],[1,1,1]]",
      "output": "[[1,0,1],[0,0,0],[1,0,1]]"
     },
     {
      "input": "matrix = [[0,1,2,0],[3,4,5,2],[1,3,1,5]]",
      "output": "[[0,0,0,0],[0,4,5,0],[0,3,1,0]]"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "m == matrix.length, n == matrix[0].length",
     "1 <= m, n <= 200",
     "-2^31 <= matrix[i][j] <= 2^31 - 1"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "直接用两个集合记录 0 的行列再统一置零，空间 O(m+n)。",
     "O(1) 空间的技巧：**用矩阵自己的第一行/第一列做标记**——`matrix[i][0]` 标记第 i 行是否有 0，`matrix[0][j]` 标记第 j 列是否有 0；再用两个变量单独记录第一行/第一列自身是否含 0。",
     "流程：① 扫描打标记；② 依据标记把第 1..m-1 行、1..n-1 列置零；③ 最后处理第一行与第一列。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "变量 `first_row / first_col` 记录第一行、第一列是否含 0",
     "扫描 `matrix[1..] × [1..]`：遇到 0 就在 `matrix[i][0]` 与 `matrix[0][j]` 打标记",
     "第二遍：若 `matrix[i][0] == 0` 则第 i 行全部置零；若 `matrix[0][j] == 0` 则第 j 列全部置零",
     "最后按 `first_row / first_col` 处理第一行、第一列"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(m·n)",
     "space": "O(1)"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def setZeroes(self, matrix: List[List[int]]) -> None:\n        m, n = len(matrix), len(matrix[0])\n        first_row = any(matrix[0][j] == 0 for j in range(n))\n        first_col = any(matrix[i][0] == 0 for i in range(m))\n\n        # 用第一行/第一列当标记数组\n        for i in range(1, m):\n            for j in range(1, n):\n                if matrix[i][j] == 0:\n                    matrix[i][0] = 0\n                    matrix[0][j] = 0\n\n        for i in range(1, m):          # 依据标记置零\n            if matrix[i][0] == 0:\n                for j in range(1, n):\n                    matrix[i][j] = 0\n        for j in range(1, n):\n            if matrix[0][j] == 0:\n                for i in range(1, m):\n                    matrix[i][j] = 0\n\n        if first_row:\n            for j in range(n):\n                matrix[0][j] = 0\n        if first_col:\n            for i in range(m):\n                matrix[i][0] = 0\n"
   },
